# The firewall backend is version-dependent (see debian/rules): 1.x shells
# out to iptables, 2.x to nftables. ${netavark:firewall} is set accordingly.
# aardvark-dns is netavark's DNS server: without it containers get no name
# resolution.
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, ${netavark:firewall}, aardvark-dns
Description: OCI container network stack
 Netavark is the container network stack used by Podman 4.4 and newer,
 replacing CNI. Required by Podman 6.
